- depends-on: [SPEC:CIO-BUS-PROTOCOL] (message format, MQTT topic mapping, QoS rules)
- depends-on: [SPEC:CIO-PRINCIPLES] ([DP-CIO-6], [DP-CIO-7], [DP-CIO-25])
- depends-on: [SPEC:CIO-CONFIG-SCHEMA] (namespace declarations, state engine definitions)
- depends-on: [SPEC:CIO-APP] (dual-bus architecture context, transport configuration)
- depends-on: [AMEND:BP-EXT] (json state engine, log mode, access policy)
- see-also: [SPEC:CIO-MCP] (parallel integration pattern — MCP server also uses MQTT on localhost)
- see-also: [AMEND:BP-CAPTURE-REPLAY] (replay transport — Node-RED could consume replayed traffic for testing)

